*~

# Logs
dev-server*.log
dev-server*.err.log
verify.log
*.log

# Codex
.codex
.atl/
.codegraph/
# Compiled output of the shared tooling configs. Nothing consumes these: every
# vitest.config.ts imports the extensionless specifier and esbuild resolves the
# .ts source first. They are only regenerated as a build side effect.
packages/tooling/configs/*.js
packages/tooling/configs/*.d.ts
packages/tooling/configs/*.js.map
packages/tooling/configs/*.d.ts.map
